mlx-nf4
=======

The package-local C++ and Metal implementation is derived from the
MIT-licensed MLX extension and quantized-kernel interfaces. Apple copyright
notices are preserved in the kernel sources, and the MLX MIT license terms are
preserved in LICENSE.

The NF4 implementation and extraction were authored by Noah Lyons in the MLX
fork history beginning with commit eccb857825439dd8c24c5cc5d27e9489fc2f4eef.
The package extraction keeps MLX itself as a runtime and build dependency; it
does not redistribute MLX or claim built-in MLX NF4 support.
